cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "worldmodel-from-scratch: build a world model, then find out where it breaks"
abstract: >-
  A six-lesson, dependency-light introduction to world models that measures
  where they fail rather than only how to build them. Every claim in the
  documentation is checked against the lessons' real output by a script that
  ships with the repository.
type: software
authors:
